  <ferc:ControlOverRespondentTextBlock id="f-9" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div style="text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;GridLiance West LLC (&#8220;the Company&#8221;), formed in 2014, is a wholly-owned subsidiary of GridLiance Western Holdings LLC (&#8220;GWH&#8221;), which in turn is an indirect subsidiary of NextEra Energy Transmission, LLC ("NEET"). NEET is an indirect subsidiary of NextEra Energy, Inc., a company listed on the New York Stock Exchange.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:ControlOverRespondentTextBlock>
